{
  "info": {
    "name": "LAVO - Admin Dashboard & Analytics API",
    "description": "Collection pour les endpoints admin de tableau de bord et d'analytiques LAVO.\n\nVariable requise : `base_url` (ex: http://localhost:3000)\nVariable requise : `access_token` (JWT admin, obtenu apres login admin)\n\n## Groupes\n- **Admin - Dashboard** : KPI snapshot (totaux, metriques de periode, alertes)\n- **Admin - Analytics** : series temporelles par metrique (transactions, revenue, commissions, etc.)\n\n## Cache\nLes deux endpoints repondent avec `Cache-Control: max-age=60, s-maxage=60`.\nUne reponse servie depuis le cache reste un 200 valide.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "access_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{access_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Admin - Dashboard",
      "description": "GET /api/v1/admin/dashboard - Retourne un snapshot KPI admin : totaux stock, metriques de periode, et alertes actionnables.\n\nLes query params sont tous optionnels. Combinaisons acceptees :\n- Aucun param → fenetre 30 jours par defaut\n- ?period=N → fenetre de N jours se terminant maintenant (1 ≤ N ≤ 365)\n- ?from=YYYY-MM-DD&to=YYYY-MM-DD → plage exacte\n\nReponse 200 : { data: { period: { from, to, days }, totals: { active_stations, total_clients, pending_kyc, open_support_tickets }, metrics: { total_transactions, total_revenue, total_commissions }, alerts: { pending_kyc, open_support_tickets } } }",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Dashboard - periode 30j (200)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Retourne la structure dashboard complete', () => {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('period');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('totals');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('metrics');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('alerts');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Period contient from, to, days', () => {",
                  "  const period = pm.response.json().data.period;",
                  "  pm.expect(period).to.have.property('from');",
                  "  pm.expect(period).to.have.property('to');",
                  "  pm.expect(period).to.have.property('days');",
                  "  pm.expect(period.days).to.eql(30);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Totals contient les 4 compteurs stock', () => {",
                  "  const totals = pm.response.json().data.totals;",
                  "  pm.expect(totals).to.have.property('active_stations');",
                  "  pm.expect(totals).to.have.property('total_clients');",
                  "  pm.expect(totals).to.have.property('pending_kyc');",
                  "  pm.expect(totals).to.have.property('open_support_tickets');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Metrics contient les KPI de periode', () => {",
                  "  const metrics = pm.response.json().data.metrics;",
                  "  pm.expect(metrics).to.have.property('total_transactions');",
                  "  pm.expect(metrics).to.have.property('total_revenue');",
                  "  pm.expect(metrics).to.have.property('total_commissions');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Alerts contient pending_kyc et open_support_tickets en tableaux', () => {",
                  "  const alerts = pm.response.json().data.alerts;",
                  "  pm.expect(alerts.pending_kyc).to.be.an('array');",
                  "  pm.expect(alerts.open_support_tickets).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": [],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/admin/dashboard?period=30",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "admin",
                "dashboard"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "period",
                  "value": "30"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Fenetre glissante de 30 jours se terminant maintenant.\n\nReponse : { data: { period: { from, to, days: 30 }, totals, metrics, alerts } }\n\nCache-Control: max-age=60, s-maxage=60 - la reponse peut etre servie depuis le cache pendant 60 secondes."
          }
        },
